    191  100c							; A = key code (v0.22 layout)
    192  100c							;   overlay	    notes
    193  100c							;   A S D F G	    bank (FAT PADS LEADS BASS FX): switches at once, same slot
    194  100c							;   Z X C V B	    patch 1-5 in the bank
    195  100c							;   L		    latch on / off	      K, then a note or a shape: key + scale
