    151  8058							; voice X's glide offset closer to 0: by off / 2^glideK for each 4 ms step
    152  8058							; (worked out once: d = off >> k, off -= d x n; past 0 or nothing left to
    153  8058							; move by: there). Keeps X.
    154  8058				   NesGlideStep
    155  8058					      subroutine
